# Copyright The SimpleKernel Contributors
#
<type>(<scope>): <subject>

# type: feat|fix|refactor|perf|test|docs|build|ci|chore|style|revert
# scope: optional English identifier, for example memory, sync, arch_primitives,
# scope: platform_fdt, xtask, docs, ci
# subject: 中文优先，保留必要英文术语，不加句号，尽量不超过 72 个字符
# breaking change: add ! before :, for example <type>(<scope>)!: <subject>
#
# body: trivial or mechanical changes may omit the body
# body: substantive changes should explain:
# body: - why this change is needed
# body: - what repository-visible behavior, API, docs, or tests changed
# body: - risk, compatibility, or rollback notes when relevant
# body: - validation that was actually run
#
# footer: add issue refs or BREAKING CHANGE only when applicable
# BREAKING CHANGE: describe migration when needed
# Signed-off-by is required; use git commit -s or git commit --signoff
# Do not include local-only host paths, scratch paths, private workflow notes, or
# ad hoc container names. Prefer repository-visible commands and evidence.
